  "full_disclaimer": "California RCFE Weekly Movers reports changes observed between two weekly California Department of Social Services (CDSS) Community Care Licensing files. A newly observed record does not necessarily mean a facility opened, and a record no longer appearing as active does not by itself confirm that a facility closed. Recorded licensed capacity is the license limit, not occupancy. Facility counts and changes do not show market saturation, demand, occupancy, profitability or investment quality. Record errors can only be corrected by CDSS. General education only; not legal, financial or investment advice.",
